# ── Customer data — must NEVER leave the server ──
# These hold names, phones, addresses and GPS coords. This repo is PUBLIC
# (it is the GitHub profile repo), so a stray `git add -A` run on the server
# would expose them. The server working tree carries all three directories.
data/orders.json
data/backups/
data/data/
data/archive/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

